! name: Financial News - Outlets
! description: Boosts reputable financial journalism and primary sources, surfaces regional business press worldwide, and removes copycat, auto-generated and low-quality stock/AI-slop sites.
! public: false
! author: Igor Netto
! avatar: #0B7A4B

! Weight scale used in this file: boost 1-4, downrank 1-4.
! 4 = top tier, 3 = strong, 2 = useful / niche.
! A domain appears in exactly ONE section so rules never conflict.

! =========================================================
! Primary sources: regulators and central banks
! =========================================================
$boost=4,site=sec.gov
$boost=4,site=federalreserve.gov
$boost=4,site=ecb.europa.eu
$boost=4,site=bankofengland.co.uk
$boost=4,site=bis.org
$boost=4,site=imf.org
$boost=3,site=treasury.gov

